css-box-shadow-generator.formula:
box-shadow: [inset] <offset-x> <offset-y> <blur> <spread> <color>;

Example: box-shadow: 0px 8px 24px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
- offset-x / offset-y: shadow position (can be negative)
- blur: softness of the edge (0 = hard edge)
- spread: grows (+) or shrinks (−) the shadow
- color: any CSS color; rgba with low alpha looks most natural
